><highlight color="#9643FC" opacity="0.399994" creationdate="D:20251014094140+10'00'" flags="print" IT="HighlightNote" date="D:20251014094142+10'00'" name="b19d6dd1-1738-4764-a13f-674535994701" page="9" coords="62.361664,582.071777,297.618591,582.071777,62.361664,572.291870,297.618591,572.291870,62.361664,570.052673,297.556854,570.052673,62.361664,560.272766,297.556854,560.272766,62.361664,558.090576,297.599792,558.090576,62.361664,548.310669,297.599792,548.310669,69.051727,548.411621,76.751846,548.411621,69.051727,538.411499,76.751846,538.411499,62.361664,546.071472,67.361725,546.071472,62.361664,536.291565,67.361725,536.291565,78.405823,546.071472,297.653748,546.071472,78.405823,536.291565,297.653748,536.291565,62.361664,534.052368,297.650513,534.052368,62.361664,524.272461,297.650513,524.272461,62.361664,522.033264,297.647400,522.033264,62.361664,512.253357,297.647400,512.253357,62.361664,510.014160,181.064423,510.014160,62.361664,500.234253,181.064423,500.234253,186.296478,510.014160,217.587585,510.014160,186.296478,499.298584,217.587585,499.298584,222.803101,510.015808,297.652924,510.015808,222.803101,500.235901,297.652924,500.235901,232.384186,500.393799,240.084305,500.393799,232.384186,490.393677,240.084305,490.393677,62.361481,498.053650,165.922150,498.053650,62.361481,488.273743,165.922150,488.273743,173.258209,498.053650,218.328598,498.053650,173.258209,488.273743,218.328598,488.273743,225.701599,498.053650,230.701660,498.053650,225.701599,488.273743,230.701660,488.273743,241.738281,498.053650,297.628845,498.053650,241.738281,488.273743,297.628845,488.273743,62.361481,486.034546,297.647064,486.034546,62.361481,476.254639,297.647064,476.254639,62.361481,474.015381,297.625305,474.015381,62.361481,464.235474,297.625305,464.235474,62.361481,461.996277,297.636353,461.996277,62.361481,452.216370,297.636353,452.216370,62.361481,449.977112,297.594788,449.977112,62.361481,440.197205,297.594788,440.197205,62.361481,438.015015,297.597260,438.015015,62.361481,428.235107,297.597260,428.235107,62.361481,425.995850,261.650208,425.995850,62.361481,416.215942,261.650208,416.215942" rect="62.055847,415.910309,297.959381,582.377441" subject="Comment on Text" title="Alexander Gibson"
><contents-richtext
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:25.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-14.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Q14c: </span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-13.3pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>This investigation suggests training programs must be&#xD;well adapted to the specific physiological requirements&#xD;of this format of basketball. Conditioning for elite&#xD;33 basketball athletes should involve exposure to&#xD;high-intensity bouts with low to moderate rest. These&#xD;bouts should require athletes to work at intensities&#xD;greater than 80% of their HR</span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-8.7pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>peak </span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-13.3pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>whilst utilising a&#xD;3:1 work-to-rest ratio. Moreover, 33 basketball&#xD;coaches may use the results of this study to prioritise&#xD;the development of certain skills within practice sessions&#xD;based on the frequency of the actions exhibited&#xD;during gameplay. The results may also inform coaches&#xD;on different tactics employed by teams as a tournament&#xD;progresses from pool games through to finals.</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="no" page="9" rect="595.276001,490.071777,779.276001,582.071777"
